Hey team,

Just wanted to send a quick note to say how much we're loving Core Platform. We've been using it for about 6 weeks now with a team of 8.

The Jira integration is fantastic. Being able to push roadmap items directly to Jira sprints without copy-pasting saved our team probably 3-4 hours per week. The sync is reliable and the field mapping was easy to set up.

The AI-generated PRD feature is also a game changer. I used it to draft a PRD for our new search feature — what would have taken me half a day took 20 minutes. The output was good enough that I only needed to make minor tweaks.

A few small suggestions that would make it even better:

1. Allow bulk-pushing multiple roadmap items to Jira at once (right now it's one at a time)
2. Add a "duplicate document" button in the document workspace — I often start a new PRD from a previous one
3. Show which roadmap items have been synced to Jira vs which haven't

Overall though, really impressed. We'll definitely be renewing and expanding to the rest of our org.

Keep up the great work!
Marcus Lee
CTO, CloudStartup Co
